<title>USA: Gore to attend OSCE summit in Lisbon.</title>
<headline>Gore to attend OSCE summit in Lisbon.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vice President Al Gore will lead the U.S. delegation to a Dec. 2 summit in Lisbon of the Organisation for Security and Cooperation in Europe, the White House said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The OSCE is a forum to promote security cooperation and human rights in Europe.</p>
<p>The summit will include leaders from 52 countries in Europe, North America and the former Soviet Union, the White House said.</p>
</text>
